  "id": "run",
  "text": "Three agents work the storm. Ops control traces how sixteen late departures spread through aircraft and crew connections, using up the spare minutes at every turn. Fifty more flights go late, seven hundred and forty-one connections break, twenty-one crews are pushed past their legal duty limit, and seven hundred and ninety passengers are now owed a refund under federal rules.",
